        "ddad1229-69cf-452f-85c1-8764ca5221a2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's Inside?",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<p>Our Asian Mystery Box is brimming with unique and exotic snacks and candies from across Asia. From beloved traditional treats to exciting new flavors, each box is filled with a diverse mix of sweet, savory, and everything in between. Expect to find:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Full-Size Snacks:<\/strong> Indulge in a generous assortment of popular Asian treats.<\/li><li><strong>Exclusive Drinks:<\/strong> Refresh with unique beverages you won’t find anywhere else.<\/li><li><strong>Crunchy and Salty Snacks:<\/strong> Delight in the satisfying crunch of trending chips and crackers.<\/li><li><strong>Delicious Chocolate Goodies:<\/strong> Enjoy the richness of premium Asian chocolate treats.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "prev_attach": false
          }
        },
        "bfcb7fcd-1b6c-41fe-a682-a28f97cb89a5": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Premium experience",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<h3>A Curated Experience<\/h3><p>Our confectionery experts are always on the lookout for the next big thing in Asian snacks. Their passion and expertise ensure that your Asian Mystery Box is a collection of the most current and exciting treats, offering a fresh and dynamic snacking experience.<\/p><h3>Perfect for Adventurers<\/h3><p>Ideal for those who love to explore new flavors, the Asian Mystery Box is your ticket to a culinary journey across Asia. It’s also a fantastic gift for friends and family who appreciate the diversity and richness of Asian cuisine.<\/p><h3>A New Box Every Month<\/h3><p>Stay on the cutting edge of Asian snacking with our regularly refreshed Asian Mystery Box. Each month, enjoy a new selection of must-have snacks, keeping your taste buds excited and delighted.<\/p><p>Get your Holly Lollies Asian Mystery Box today and embark on a delicious adventure with the best treats Asia has to offer! 🌏🍬🥤<\/p>",
            "prev_attach": false
          }
        }
      },
