          "settings": {
            "video": "https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/ef8b66c50d744f679d4a96fd15e74ba1.mp4",
            "headline": "“Tasting the Japanese KitKat Matcha was like a quick trip back to Japan. The variety in this box is incredible – each candy is a new discovery. For anyone thinking about trying Holly Lollies, I say go for it. Holly Lollies, you've got yourself a fan – this is easily a 10\/10 from me!\"",
