            "headline": "\"The Asian Mystery Box is a fantastic treat! I enjoyed the mix of sweet and savory snacks, especially the Koikeya chips and Meiji chocolates. It's a great way to discover the flavors of Asia without leaving home. Holly Lollies, you’ve outdone yourselves!\"",
