    "d_faq_rcftkD": {
      "type": "d_faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_qtQAkX": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What can I expect in every of the boxes that you offer?",
            "icon": "",
            "text": "<p>n each Holly Lollies mystery box, you’ll find a delightful assortment of snacks and treats tailored to your unique tastes and cravings:<\/p><p><strong>Trendy Mystery Box<\/strong> 🎉<br\/>Stay ahead of the snacking curve with the Trendy Mystery Box! Packed with the latest and most popular snacks, this box is bursting with sweet and savory treats that everyone’s talking about. Perfect for trendsetters who love discovering the hottest new snacks. 🍫🥨<\/p><p><strong>Asian Mystery Box<\/strong> 🍜<br\/>Embark on a culinary adventure with the Asian Mystery Box! This box brings you a vibrant mix of unique and exotic snacks from Japan, Korea, China, and more. Enjoy favorites like Pocky, Matcha KitKats, Ramune soda, and other delightful surprises that transport your taste buds to Asia. 🍣🍵<\/p><p><strong>Discount Mystery Box<\/strong> 💸<br\/>Unwrap incredible value with the Discount Mystery Box! Filled with delicious snacks that are close to their best-by date, these treats are still fresh and flavorful. It’s a fantastic way to enjoy a variety of snacks at a lower price, perfect for the budget-conscious snacker. 🛍️🍪<\/p><p>Each Holly Lollies box is lovingly curated to ensure a fun and satisfying snacking experience, focusing on variety and quality. No matter which box you choose, you’re in for a treat! Get ready to delight your taste buds with Holly Lollies! 🎁✨<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_C7XGBb": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you ship internationally?",
            "icon": "",
            "text": "<p>We currently ship to EU countries only, get ready for a flavor-filled journey because our candies are set to make your taste buds dance! 🍬🇪🇺<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_kTCGUE": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Frequently asked question",
            "icon": "",
            "text": "<p>As soon as your Holly Lollies order sets off from our candy haven,<strong>we'll pop an email your way.<\/strong>This isn't just any email – it's your golden ticket to track your treasure trove of treats! 💌 You'll find a tracking number inside, your key to unlock live updates on your candy's journey, all the way to your doorstep. And hey, if you need a hand or have a question, we're just a message away. Let's make this a smooth, sweet ride together! 🍬💫<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_7KednD": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "There's a problem with my order, what do I do?",
            "icon": "",
            "text": "<p>Oh no, a bump in the candy road! 🙁 We're so sorry to hear that there's an issue with your order. But don't worry, our Holly Lollies team is here to turn that frown upside down! 🌟<\/p><p><strong>Please drop us a line at <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:info@hollylollies.com\" title=\"mailto:info@hollylollies.com\"><strong>info@hollylollies.com<\/strong><\/a><strong> <\/strong>with all the sweet details – like your order number, what's up with the order, and any photos if you've got 'em. We're on the case to make things right and ensure your candy journey is nothing but delightful! 🍭💌<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_GpNVB7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long will it take to receive my order?",
            "icon": "",
            "text": "<p>With our standard shipping, your delightful Holly Lollies treats will typically arrive in<strong>2-5 working days.<\/strong>🕒🍬 And guess what? We're stirring up something even sweeter – working hard to bring you next-day delivery soon! So, keep an eye out and get ready for a lightning-fast candy drop right at your doorstep!<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_D9Nmq3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I return my order?",
            "icon": "",
            "text": "<p>At Holly Lollies, we pour our heart into every package. If your candies aren't just right or there's a mix-up, don't fret! We do accept returns. Simply send your box back to us, and we’ll refund your money with no questions asked. Just shoot us an email at<a>info@hollylollies.com<\/a>. We're all ears and ready to chat about any concerns or mishaps to ensure your Holly Lollies experience stays as delightful as our treats!<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_TgpjbQ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What payment options do you offer?",
            "icon": "",
            "text": "<p>At Holly Lollies, we make checking out as easy as picking your favorite candy. Choose from a variety of payment options at checkout:<strong>Debit\/Credit Card, PayPal, Apple Pay, or Google Pay.<\/strong>🛍️💳 And don't you worry – all your payment details are wrapped up safe and secure, just like our candies. So, go ahead and shop with complete peace of mind!<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6khiBN": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why does the date on my Asian product seem like it's expired?",
            "icon": "",
            "text": "<p>At Holly Lollies, we understand the excitement of trying our carefully selected Asian treats, and we want to assure you that freshness is our top priority. It's quite common in Asia to mark products with the manufacturing date rather than the expiry date, which may seem unusual but is a standard practice. This date signifies when your delightful Holly Lollies snack was made, ensuring you're enjoying authentic and fresh flavors.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_TY8dVt": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Got a Question or Just Want to Chat?",
            "icon": "",
            "text": "<p>We're all ears at Holly Lollies! If you've got any questions, concerns, or just some sweet feedback, we're here for you.<strong>Feel free to drop us an email at<\/strong><a href=\"mailto:info@hollylollies.com\"><strong>info@hollylollies.com<\/strong><\/a><strong>.<\/strong>Our team is on standby from 9am to 5pm (GMT+2), Monday through Friday, and we aim to get back to you within 24 hours. Let's talk candy!<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_ypU7iD": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "🌟 Social Media Star?",
            "icon": "",
            "text": "<p>Join the Holly Lollies Family - Influencers & Creators Welcome! 🎉📸 Whether you're a budding micro-influencer or a seasoned content creator, we're excited to team up with you! At Holly Lollies, we believe in the power of collaboration, no matter the size of your audience. Reach out to us at<a href=\"mailto:info@hollylollies.com\">info@hollylollies.com<\/a>and let's chat about spreading the sweet joy of our candy boxes. Don't hesitate – we're eager to work with creators of all kinds and spread the Holly Lollies happiness as far as we can. Your voice matters, and together, we can make the world a little sweeter, one box at a time!<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
